[
  {
    "content": "许多人认为专注只是强迫自己盯着某物几个小时",
    "from": 6.36,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 1,
    "to": 12.5
  },
  {
    "content": "但这就像徒手推墙一样无效",
    "from": 12.5,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 2,
    "to": 16.509
  },
  {
    "content": "秘诀在于引导能量而非浪费",
    "from": 16.509,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 3,
    "to": 20.649
  },
  {
    "content": "就像激光束聚焦光线一样",
    "from": 20.649,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 4,
    "to": 24.63
  },
  {
    "content": "拥有切割钢铁的力量",
    "from": 24.63,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 5,
    "to": 26.5
  },
  {
    "content": "当你以 relentless precision 集中注意力",
    "from": 26.5,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 6,
    "to": 30.5
  },
  {
    "content": "能突破生命中的任何障碍",
    "from": 30.5,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 7,
    "to": 33.58
  },
  {
    "content": "请仔细听我说",
    "from": 33.58,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 8,
    "to": 35.28
  },
  {
    "content": "因为这能改变你对自己的看法",
    "from": 35.28,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 9,
    "to": 37.8
  },
  {
    "content": "你的大脑如同粒子加速器",
    "from": 37.8,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 10,
    "to": 41.03
  },
  {
    "content": "每秒有数十亿电信号在发射",
    "from": 41.03,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 11,
    "to": 44.43
  },
  {
    "content": "碰撞",
    "from": 44.43,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 12,
    "to": 45.35
  },
  {
    "content": "撞击",
    "from": 45.35,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 13,
    "to": 46.13
  },
  {
    "content": "创造新连接",
    "from": 46.13,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 14,
    "to": 47.63
  },
  {
    "content": "但若缺乏方向",
    "from": 47.63,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 15,
    "to": 49.43
  },
  {
    "content": "所有活动都混乱无序",
    "from": 49.43,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 16,
    "to": 51.63
  },
  {
    "content": "散乱无果",
    "from": 51.63,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 17,
    "to": 53.55
  },
  {
    "content": "当你学会创建专注轨道",
    "from": 53.55,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 18,
    "to": 56.41
  },
  {
    "content": "就像物理学家用磁场引导粒子直线运动",
    "from": 56.41,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 19,
    "to": 61.71
  },
  {
    "content": "曾经的混乱转化为有序力量",
    "from": 61.71,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 20,
    "to": 66.17
  },
  {
    "content": "这是训练大脑的第一秘诀",
    "from": 66.17,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 21,
    "to": 69.37
  },
  {
    "content": "不是想尽一切",
    "from": 69.37,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 22,
    "to": 71.63
  },
  {
    "content": "而是以如此强度聚焦一事让周围世界消失",
    "from": 71.63,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 23,
    "to": 77.29
  },
  {
    "content": "而纪律正是关键",
    "from": 77.29,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 24,
    "to": 79.66
  },
  {
    "content": "不要将纪律等同于痛苦纪律实为简化艺术",
    "from": 79.66,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 25,
    "to": 85.58
  },
  {
    "content": "若无法简单解释",
    "from": 85.58,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 26,
    "to": 88.49
  },
  {
    "content": "说明你尚未真正理解",
    "from": 88.49,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 27,
    "to": 90.35
  },
  {
    "content": "同样适用于生活",
    "from": 90.35,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 28,
    "to": 92.08
  },
  {
    "content": "若所做之事过于复杂",
    "from": 92.08,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 29,
    "to": 94.46
  },
  {
    "content": "是因为尚未找到产生真正专注的清晰度",
    "from": 94.46,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 30,
    "to": 99.03
  },
  {
    "content": "所以这是第一个练习",
    "from": 99.03,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 31,
    "to": 100.65
  },
  {
    "content": "我让你做",
    "from": 100.65,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 32,
    "to": 101.79
  },
  {
    "content": "选择一个目标",
    "from": 101.79,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 33,
    "to": 103.19
  },
  {
    "content": "仅一个并用一句话写下来",
    "from": 103.19,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 34,
    "to": 106.69
  },
  {
    "content": "简单",
    "from": 106.69,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 35,
    "to": 107.69
  },
  {
    "content": "清晰直接",
    "from": 107.69,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 36,
    "to": 109.69
  },
  {
    "content": "若无法总结",
    "from": 109.69,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 37,
    "to": 111.51
  },
  {
    "content": "说明你尚未明确真正需求",
    "from": 111.51,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 38,
    "to": 114.41
  },
  {
    "content": "深呼吸反思你已浪费多少年试图包揽一切",
    "from": 115.24,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 39,
    "to": 120.12
  },
  {
    "content": "其实秘诀在于精简",
    "from": 120.12,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 40,
    "to": 123.08
  },
  {
    "content": "想想牛顿",
    "from": 123.08,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 41,
    "to": 124.37
  },
  {
    "content": "想想爱因斯坦这些天才专注少数问题数十年",
    "from": 124.37,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 42,
    "to": 129.85
  },
  {
    "content": "正因如此他们成就非凡",
    "from": 129.85,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 43,
    "to": 132.91
  },
  {
    "content": "你的专注是最强大武器",
    "from": 132.91,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 44,
    "to": 135.59
  },
  {
    "content": "像激光束般使用",
    "from": 135.59,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 45,
    "to": 137.17
  },
  {
    "content": "你的大脑如同望远镜",
    "from": 137.17,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 46,
    "to": 139.37
  },
  {
    "content": "若不指向任何事物",
    "from": 139.37,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 47,
    "to": 140.65
  },
  {
    "content": "只能看到黑暗",
    "from": 140.65,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 48,
    "to": 141.77
  },
  {
    "content": "但若调整镜头选择一颗恒星",
    "from": 141.77,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 49,
    "to": 145.32
  },
  {
    "content": "整个宇宙将逐渐显现",
    "from": 145.32,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 50,
    "to": 148.78
  },
  {
    "content": "专注的本质就是消除干扰的能力",
    "from": 148.78,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 51,
    "to": 152.61
  },
  {
    "content": "这样你才能看清真正重要的事物",
    "from": 152.61,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 52,
    "to": 154.67
  },
  {
    "content": "但真正的关键问题在于",
    "from": 154.67,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 53,
    "to": 156.53
  },
  {
    "content": "如何培养更强的专注力",
    "from": 156.53,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 54,
    "to": 159.15
  },
  {
    "content": "请专注当下",
    "from": 159.15,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 55,
    "to": 160.05
  },
  {
    "content": "因为真相是",
    "from": 160.05,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 56,
    "to": 161.07
  },
  {
    "content": "几乎没人敢承认",
    "from": 161.07,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 57,
    "to": 163.01
  },
  {
    "content": "专注不是你发现的东西",
    "from": 163.01,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 58,
    "to": 164.45
  },
  {
    "content": "而是需要训练的能力",
    "from": 164.45,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 59,
    "to": 165.35
  },
  {
    "content": "就像肌肉一样",
    "from": 165.35,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 60,
    "to": 167.05
  },
  {
    "content": "没有人天生具备绝对的自律",
    "from": 167.05,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 61,
    "to": 168.87
  },
  {
    "content": "但任何人都能培养出它",
    "from": 168.87,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 62,
    "to": 171.29
  },
  {
    "content": "想想那个花费数小时调试实验的物理学家",
    "from": 171.29,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 63,
    "to": 173.15
  },
  {
    "content": "每一次细微调整都是对抗分心的胜利",
    "from": 173.15,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 64,
    "to": 176.81
  },
  {
    "content": "同样的道理适用于你想要更多专注",
    "from": 176.81,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 65,
    "to": 180.29
  },
  {
    "content": "创造让分心无处可藏的环境",
    "from": 180.29,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 66,
    "to": 183.7
  },
  {
    "content": "去除多余干扰",
    "from": 183.7,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 67,
    "to": 187.12
  },
  {
    "content": "关闭通知提醒",
    "from": 187.12,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 68,
    "to": 188.76
  },
  {
    "content": "写下接下来一小时的具体计划",
    "from": 188.76,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 69,
    "to": 190.81
  },
  {
    "content": "并只执行这些任务",
    "from": 190.81,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 70,
    "to": 193.33
  },
  {
    "content": "这听起来简单",
    "from": 193.33,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 71,
    "to": 196.27
  },
  {
    "content": "确实很简单",
    "from": 196.27,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 72,
    "to": 197.47
  },
  {
    "content": "但正因如此才有效",
    "from": 197.47,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 73,
    "to": 199.93
  },
  {
    "content": "如果你无法营造利于专注的环境",
    "from": 199.93,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 74,
    "to": 202.89
  },
  {
    "content": "说明你尚未真正了解自己的心智训练",
    "from": 202.89,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 75,
    "to": 206.1
  },
  {
    "content": "专注是训练心智做出选择",
    "from": 206.1,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 76,
    "to": 208.86
  },
  {
    "content": "每个选择都是力量的体现",
    "from": 208.86,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 77,
    "to": 211.42
  },
  {
    "content": "不要自欺欺人",
    "from": 211.42,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 78,
    "to": 214.8
  },
  {
    "content": "每次屈服于分心就是在强化弱点",
    "from": 214.8,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 79,
    "to": 217.15
  },
  {
    "content": "每次拒绝干扰",
    "from": 217.15,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 80,
    "to": 219.55
  },
  {
    "content": "就是在强化专注力",
    "from": 219.55,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 81,
    "to": 221.86
  },
  {
    "content": "这里有一个实用练习",
    "from": 221.86,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 82,
    "to": 224.34
  },
  {
    "content": "每天划出30分钟专注完成单一任务不被打扰",
    "from": 224.34,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 83,
    "to": 230.829
  },
  {
    "content": "如果思绪开始游离",
    "from": 230.829,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 84,
    "to": 232.589
  },
  {
    "content": "立刻拉回注意力",
    "from": 232.589,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 85,
    "to": 233.329
  },
  {
    "content": "无论发生多少次",
    "from": 233.329,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 86,
    "to": 235.469
  },
  {
    "content": "这就像训练体能耐力",
    "from": 235.469,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 87,
    "to": 238.389
  },
  {
    "content": "起初会感到痛苦",
    "from": 238.389,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 88,
    "to": 240.079
  },
  {
    "content": "但随后你会发现痛苦转化为力量",
    "from": 240.079,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 89,
    "to": 243.219
  },
  {
    "content": "只需几周时间",
    "from": 243.219,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 90,
    "to": 244.499
  },
  {
    "content": "你就能深入专注任何选择的事物",
    "from": 244.499,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 91,
    "to": 248.47
  },
  {
    "content": "记住这一点",
    "from": 248.47,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 92,
    "to": 249.88
  },
  {
    "content": "大脑具有可塑性",
    "from": 249.88,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 93,
    "to": 251.68
  },
  {
    "content": "它会自我塑造",
    "from": 251.68,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 94,
    "to": 252.96
  },
  {
    "content": "取决于你如何使用",
    "from": 252.96,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 95,
    "to": 254.44
  },
  {
    "content": "如果你给予",
    "from": 254.44,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 96,
    "to": 255.46
  },
  {
    "content": "分心",
    "from": 255.46,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 97,
    "to": 255.92
  },
  {
    "content": "它就会变得散漫",
    "from": 255.92,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 98,
    "to": 257.14
  },
  {
    "content": "如果你培养专注",
    "from": 257.14,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 99,
    "to": 258.919
  },
  {
    "content": "它会像刀刃般锐利",
    "from": 258.919,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 100,
    "to": 260.819
  },
  {
    "content": "选择权在你手中",
    "from": 260.819,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 101,
    "to": 262.479
  },
  {
    "content": "现在我要告诉你一些可能让你感到刺痛的话（如果你选择放弃的话）",
    "from": 262.479,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 102,
    "to": 266.25
  },
  {
    "content": "仅仅因为有人嘲笑你",
    "from": 266.25,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 103,
    "to": 268.19
  },
  {
    "content": "这意味着你尚未真正理解内在力量的本质",
    "from": 268.19,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 104,
    "to": 271.49
  },
  {
    "content": "如果你因疲惫而停止",
    "from": 271.49,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 105,
    "to": 273.72
  },
  {
    "content": "说明你仍未意识到身体永远能突破极限",
    "from": 273.72,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 106,
    "to": 276.98
  },
  {
    "content": "当思维发出指令时",
    "from": 276.98,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 107,
    "to": 278.37
  },
  {
    "content": "专注力不会在安逸中生长",
    "from": 278.37,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 108,
    "to": 280.71
  },
  {
    "content": "它诞生于直面痛苦的时刻",
    "from": 280.71,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 109,
    "to": 282.92
  },
  {
    "content": "牺牲",
    "from": 282.92,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 110,
    "to": 283.74
  },
  {
    "content": "却依然选择继续前行",
    "from": 283.74,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 111,
    "to": 285.94
  },
  {
    "content": "这就是钢铁在烈火中锻造的过程",
