    "content": "在笔记本上写下",
    "from": 291.779,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 114,
    "to": 293.279
  },
  {
    "content": "我今天做了什么",
    "from": 293.279,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 115,
    "to": 294.619
  },
  {
    "content": "让我更接近目标",
    "from": 294.619,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 116,
    "to": 296.37
  },
  {
    "content": "什么分散了我的注意力",
    "from": 296.37,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 117,
    "to": 297.79
  },
  {
    "content": "我本可以做得更好",
    "from": 297.79,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 118,
    "to": 299.27
  },
  {
    "content": "这个每日重复的简单动作",
    "from": 299.27,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 119,
    "to": 301.59
  },
  {
    "content": "会培养敏锐的思维",
    "from": 301.59,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 120,
    "to": 303.24
  },
  {
    "content": "就像科学家复盘实验的每个细节",
    "from": 303.24,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 121,
    "to": 306.62
  },
  {
    "content": "直到无所遗漏",
    "from": 306.62,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 122,
    "to": 308.27
  },
  {
    "content": "坚持这样做几周",
    "from": 308.27,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 123,
    "to": 309.99
  },
  {
    "content": "你将不再是同一个人",
    "from": 309.99,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 124,
    "to": 312.35
  },
  {
    "content": "未能活出潜力的遗憾重如千钧",
    "from": 312.35,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 125,
    "to": 316.07
  },
  {
    "content": "远超纪律的痛苦",
    "from": 316.07,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 126,
    "to": 317.53
  },
  {
    "content": "早起学习的痛苦",
    "from": 317.53,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 127,
    "to": 320.08
  },
  {
    "content": "当你不想坚持时的挣扎",
    "from": 320.08,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 128,
    "to": 322.69
  },
  {
    "content": "当无人相信你时的煎熬",
    "from": 322.69,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 129,
    "to": 325.81
  },
  {
    "content": "但竭尽全力的遗憾永存不灭",
    "from": 325.81,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 130,
    "to": 328.6
  },
  {
    "content": "所以与自己立下契约",
    "from": 328.6,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 131,
    "to": 330.26
  },
  {
    "content": "现在",
    "from": 330.26,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 132,
    "to": 330.78
  },
  {
    "content": "像天才般训练你的思维",
    "from": 330.78,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 133,
    "to": 332.44
  },
  {
    "content": "变得不可摧毁",
    "from": 333.6,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 134,
    "to": 335.08
  },
  {
    "content": "现在",
    "from": 335.08,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 135,
    "to": 335.42
  },
  {
    "content": "想象这个场景",
    "from": 335.42,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 136,
    "to": 336.53
  },
  {
    "content": "你正面对一个难题",
    "from": 336.53,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 137,
    "to": 338.49
  },
  {
    "content": "那种看似不可能的问题",
    "from": 338.49,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 138,
    "to": 340.63
  },
  {
    "content": "大多数人选择放弃",
    "from": 340.63,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 139,
    "to": 341.89
  },
  {
    "content": "因为他们将挑战视为折磨",
    "from": 341.89,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 140,
    "to": 343.97
  },
  {
    "content": "但天才看待同样的问题",
    "from": 343.97,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 141,
    "to": 346.09
  },
  {
    "content": "仿佛在玩一场游戏",
    "from": 346.09,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 142,
    "to": 347.419
  },
  {
    "content": "这就是伟人如何将物理转化为",
    "from": 347.419,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 143,
    "to": 350.899
  },
  {
    "content": "令人着迷的事物",
    "from": 350.899,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 144,
    "to": 351.559
  },
  {
    "content": "物理学家并非出于义务研究",
    "from": 351.559,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 145,
    "to": 354.079
  },
  {
    "content": "他们玩转概念",
    "from": 354.079,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 146,
    "to": 355.88
  },
  {
    "content": "他们勾画",
    "from": 355.88,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 147,
    "to": 357.02
  },
  {
    "content": "他们创造有趣的隐喻",
    "from": 357.02,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 148,
    "to": 358.84
  },
  {
    "content": "而这正是他们能深入探索的原因",
    "from": 358.84,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 149,
    "to": 361.289
  },
  {
    "content": "这里藏着人类学习最伟大的秘密",
