    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 158,
    "to": 386.91
  },
  {
    "content": "练习或创作便成为自我奖励",
    "from": 386.91,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 159,
    "to": 390.11
  },
  {
    "content": "这是你需要理解的关键",
    "from": 390.11,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 160,
    "to": 392.29
  },
  {
    "content": "专注并非靠蛮力维持",
    "from": 392.29,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 161,
    "to": 395.1
  },
  {
    "content": "而是源于 fascination（迷恋）",
    "from": 395.1,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 162,
    "to": 396.6
  },
  {
    "content": "想提升专注力和自律",
    "from": 396.6,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 163,
    "to": 399.08
  },
  {
