    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 167,
    "to": 407.44
  },
  {
    "content": "通过这样做",
    "from": 407.44,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 168,
    "to": 408.38
  },
  {
    "content": "你激活了好奇心，好奇心如同思维磁铁",
